WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:06.120
Let's look at a feature that helps you see if you already have the item you're trying to add.

2
00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:09.400
Take, for example, the 3376 in my collection.

3
00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:17.030
I'm going to add a 3376 to my collection, and you'll notice this pops up

4
00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:18.710
and shows me that I already have one.

5
00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:22.470
I can hit View and see the detail page.

6
00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:28.470
That way I know if I have it already, or if I'm adding a new one.
